## Summit

After a good 1.5 hours at the summit cross of the Mattstock, 1,935 m.
Panoramic views over Lake Walen, the Churfirsten and as far as the Glarus Alps.
<HikeImage idx={24} />
<HikeImage idx={25} />
<HikeImage idx={26} />
<HikeImage idx={27} />

## Descent to Amden

Return along the same route over the ridge and through the avalanche barriers,
then continue downwards towards Amden.
<HikeImage idx={28} />
<HikeImage idx={29} />
<HikeImage idx={30} />

The final vertical metres lead through woodland and across alpine pastures down to the village.
<HikeImage idx={31} />
<HikeImage idx={32} />

## Journey home

Return journey from Amden, village.
